Sumālin rises from Rasātala with ministers --- Sumālin urges Rāvaṇa to reclaim Laṅkā --- Rāvaṇa hesitates over Kubēra seniority --- Prahasta cites gods seizing Daitya earth --- Rāvaṇa sends Prahasta demanding Laṅkā --- Kubēra consults Viśravas and quits for Kailāsa --- Prahasta reports empty Laṅkā --- Rāvaṇa enters Laṅkā and receives consecration
